msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Opslaan…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:146
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr ""
"Opgeslagen: de cover, achtergrond en details worden opnieuw opgehaald als "
"PC5 opent."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:147
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "Gewist: PC5 leest de map van de game opnieuw."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:149 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "Niet opgeslagen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "; GOG-product %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 kiest de cover, achtergrond en details van de game op basis van dit "
"nummer (%s%s). Zijn ze van een andere game, typ dan het nummer uit de "
"Steam-winkellink van de game (store.steampowered.com/app/<nummer>). Leeg: "
"PC5 leest de map opnieuw."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:172
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "Opgeslagen: wordt gebruikt bij de volgende start van de game."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:187
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Nog geen games."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:190
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-schijf"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "kan niet starten"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Instellingen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:199
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Nieuwste log"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:201
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Probleem melden"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:202
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Downloadt het nieuwste log en opent het ingevulde formulier van GitHub: "
"voeg het log daar toe."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:208
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Startopties (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:209
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"De eerste regel die niet leeg is en geen opmerking (# of ;), wordt "
"toegevoegd aan de opdrachtregel van het programma."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Omgevingsvariabelen (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Eén NAAM=waarde per regel, ingesteld voordat de game start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:213
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:214
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Alleen als een issue erom vraagt, bijvoorbeeld err+all,+seh. Maak het "
"daarna weer leeg: het maakt de game trager."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
